      "filename": "More support for the Major Oak - geograph.org.uk - 1330600.jpg",
      "title": "File:More support for the Major Oak - geograph.org.uk - 1330600.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/More_support_for_the_Major_Oak_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1330600.jpg",
